{"title": "Astral Gravity (Condition)", "pageid": 31828, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Astral_Gravity_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Jump_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Astral Gravity</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Gravity on the Astral Plane is different than on Faerûn.</li>\n<li>The affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Falling_damage\" title=\"Falling damage\">Falling damage</a> and its <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> distance is tripled.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Carrying_capacity\" title=\"Carrying capacity\">Carrying capacity</a> is tripled. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon